se: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">각 그룹별</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의 최대 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">40%</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">까지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">100~90</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">점의 성적을 부여할 수 있으며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 89</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">점 이하의 성적 부여자 비율은 담당 교수 재량으로 함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">나. 변경사유 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">현재 특성화 교과목의 경우 대학생으로서 기본적인 공통 핵심역량을 강화</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전공교육에 대한 전문성 향상과 해외 유학준비</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">취업</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">진로 준비 및 자격증 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">취득등 학점취득과 병행할 수 있는 차별화된 프로그램의 취지를 살려 상대평가 미적용으로 운영하였으나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과도한 온정적 성적평가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일부과목 고득점 취득자 다수 발생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">및 특성화 교과목 수강 편중 부작용이 발생하여 성적평가기준을 다소 강화하였음</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다. 자세한 문의 사항은 열린사이버대학(OCU) 컨소시엄운영팀(02-2197-4241)으로 문의 하시기 바랍니다. </span></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">첨부 : 특성화 교과목 목록 1부.</span></span></p><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -78pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 234pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴바탕\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
